### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 72/100.** Evidence TB2.0 63.5% ; Tau3 70.6% ; NL2Repo 42.7; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 70/100.** Evidence GPQA 86.2 ; HLE 31%; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 70/100.** 128K total — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 50/100.** Text in/out; scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 78/100.** Evidence SWE-Pro 58.4% SOTA ; SWE-Verified 74.2; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 60/100.** Paid $1.20/$4.40 per 1M coding.
- **Overall Score: 68/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (72+70+70+50+78)/5=68.0 → 68; best-fit per scoring methodology.

